title: knife
---
Brother: Jesus dude is that a knife?
Brother: I haven't seen this brand in ages.
->When did you last see them?
	Brother: When me and dad used to go camping together.
	Brother: He never let me use it though
	Brother: Said it wasn't safe for a 10 year old.
	Brother: Or whatever
->Yeah, cuz ur so old.
	Brother: Shut up... 
	Brother: I was literally your age dad and I went camping
	Brother: and we got to use that cool knife
	Brother: So I'm cooler than you

