title: CD
---
Brother: Dude this is SICK! 
Brother: How'd you know I like this?
->It looks like your hoodie
	Brother: Um yeah, it's cool. 
	Brother: I dig post emo punk rock. 
	Brother: Especially when me and my band were still going
	Brother: We got soooo many chicks
	Brother: Well, not really
	Brother: But we would play songs about getting chicks
->It looks weird like you!
	Brother: It's not weird, it's cool.
	Brother: And look whos talking
	Brother: All you wear is that stupid dino shirt
	Brother: Ugh, colors are so overrated
	Brother: That was also the name of our band
	Brother:...We didn't sound very good

